# WRPC host tool documentation

This directory documents the generic `tools/wrpc` host utility. The single
source file `wrpc_tool.tex` is compiled as a standalone PDF and is also
included as an appendix fragment by the WRPC user manual in `wr-cores`.

## Build the standalone PDF

From this directory, run:

```sh
make
```

The PDF is written to `build/wrpc_tool_doc.pdf`.

The host utility is built from `tools/wrpc.c`. From the `wrpc-sw` root, use:

```sh
make menuconfig       # configure the WRPC software when needed
make tools             # build tools/wrpc and the companion host tools
```

For a complete firmware build, configure the target and platform with
`make menuconfig`, then run `make`. The RISC-V toolchain must be in `PATH`.

To remove generated files:

```sh
make clean
```